ele366y@yahoo.com wrote:
> Well, I'm not getting why
> when I engrave the E-word with my fingers, monsters frequently get in
> hits.  What is up?

Because you write it in the dust, which has a 1-in-25 chance to mess up 
any given letter. What you can do is

- write the word multiple times (one turn/10 letters)
- write with a magic marker (uses one charge /2letters)
- write with a wand of fire/digging/lightning (uses one charge)
- write with a hard gem or ring (one turn per letter)
- write with a pointed weapon (one turn/letter, dulls the weapon)
- write with an athame (one turn/10 letters, no dulling if uncursed)

